OL,3,CNew Liverpool Vice-Chairman says new
OL,4,Cjob is 'stuff of dreams'
OL,6,FThe new Vice-Chairman of Liverpool FC
OL,7,Fhas vowed he can add value to what he
OL,8,Fcalls "the greatest football club in
OL,9,Fthe world".
OL,11,FAmit Bhatia leads the 1892 Holdings
OL,12,Fconsortium, which reached a deal with
OL,13,FLiverpool FC's owners the Fenway
OL,14,FSports Group (FSG) to buy a minority
OL,15,Fstake in the club in August 2026.
OL,17,FWhile the deal has yet to receive
OL,18,Fregulatory approval, the 46-year-old
OL,19,Fwill attend Liverpool's first home
OL,20,Fgame of the season against Nottingham
OL,21,FForest on Saturday 29 August.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,308,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F307A1788286801
OL,3,CNew Liverpool Vice-Chairman says new
OL,4,Cjob is 'stuff of dreams'
OL,6,FSpeaking to LFC TV, Mr Bhatia said:
OL,7,F"It feels incredible... It feels
OL,8,Fsurreal when I hear those words,
OL,9,Fobviously an incredibly proud moment
OL,10,Ffor myself, for my family, for our
OL,11,Fpartners.
OL,13,F"We're talking about Liverpool
OL,14,FFootball Club here, right? I mean,
OL,15,Fwe're talking about the greatest
OL,16,Ffootball club in the world. And so to
OL,17,Fhave the ability to be involved in any
OL,18,Fcapacity is a huge privilege and a
OL,19,Fhuge honour.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,308,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F307A1788286801
OL,3,CNew Liverpool Vice-Chairman says new
OL,4,Cjob is 'stuff of dreams'
OL,6,F"Frankly it's the stuff of dreams. And
OL,7,Fit is the greatest honour I think that
OL,8,Fanybody can have."
OL,10,FThe British-Indian millionaire is a
OL,11,Fformer investment banker who acted as
OL,12,Fthe director and co-owner of Queens
OL,13,FPark Rangers until he stood down after
OL,14,F18 years in July 2026.
OL,16,FMr Bhatia said that while FSG are
OL,17,Fstill firmly in charge of the club,
OL,18,Fhis consortium stands ready to help
OL,19,Fimprove Liverpool FC.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,308,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F307A1788286801
OL,3,CNew Liverpool Vice-Chairman says new
OL,4,Cjob is 'stuff of dreams'
OL,6,FHe said: "I think it's important to be
OL,7,Fvery clear that this club remains
OL,8,Funder the ownership of FSG. FSG are
OL,9,Fthe decision-makers and this is their
OL,10,Fownership.
OL,12,F"And so my involvement really, or our
OL,13,Finvolvement really, would be in any
OL,14,Fcapacity that FSG felt that we could
OL,15,Fbe useful to them.
OL,17,F"We come from different geographies,
OL,18,Fwe come from different professions,
OL,19,Fand hopefully with that you bring
OL,20,Fdifferent experiences and ideas,
OL,21,Fdifferent thoughts."
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,308,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F307A1788286801
OL,3,CNew Liverpool Vice-Chairman says new
OL,4,Cjob is 'stuff of dreams'
OL,6,FMr Bhatia also vowed to do everything
OL,7,Fin his power to ensure he made
OL,8,FLiverpool's fans and supporters proud
OL,9,Fof their club.
OL,11,FHe said: "All that we can hope for is
OL,12,Fthat we can bring more success to the
OL,13,Fclub. But more importantly, that we
OL,14,Fcan make the fans even more proud of
OL,15,Fthe football club that they support,
OL,16,Fthat they represent, that shapes their
OL,17,FSunday mornings or their Mondays in
OL,18,Fthe office.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,308,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30706
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F307A1788286801
OL,3,CNew Liverpool Vice-Chairman says new
OL,4,Cjob is 'stuff of dreams'
OL,6,F"And that's a huge responsibility. But
OL,7,FI think that that's something I
OL,8,Frecognise, something that I have
OL,9,Finteracted with and it's been very
OL,10,Fimportant to me in my heart throughout
OL,11,Fmy involvement in sport."
OL,13,FThe consortium's purchase of a
OL,14,Fminority stake comes at a critical
OL,15,Ftime for the club, which suffered a
OL,16,Fdisappointing 2025/26 season which
OL,17,Fended with the sacking of Arne Slot.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
