PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F307A1788286801
OL,3,CNew Liverpool Vice-Chairman says new
OL,4,Cjob is 'stuff of dreams'
OL,6,FAll eyes are now on new manager Andoni
OL,7,FIraola, who will be hoping the
OL,8,Fconsortium can help him re-energise a
OL,9,FLiverpool squad that slumped to fifth
OL,10,Flast season, just months after their
OL,11,Fhistoric title win.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G7/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
